{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "name": "GDatePicker",
  "tag": "g-datepicker",
  "status": "candidate",
  "since": "0.1.0",
  "description": "Selector de una fecha o de un rango (valor ISO YYYY-MM-DD): uno o dos meses según el ancho, campo(s) con popover u hoja inferior en móvil, o solo la superficie en línea. Franja de rango continua, proximidad ± N días, teclado APG y textos por labels.",
  "contract": "design/contracts/datepicker.md",
  "prototype": "design/lab/datepicker/r01/",
  "style": "packages/vue/src/components/GDatePicker/GDatePicker.css",
  "tagAlias": "GDatepicker (Vue resuelve <g-datepicker> como GDatepicker; el registro incluye ese alias además de GDatePicker)",
  "props": [
    {
      "name": "modelValue",
      "type": "String | Object | null",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "mode",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "single",
      "values": [
        "single",
        "range"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "inline",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "open",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "min",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "max",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "disabledDates",
      "type": "Function",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "months",
      "type": "String | Number",
      "default": "auto",
      "values": [
        "auto",
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "locale",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "firstDay",
      "type": "Number",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "labels",
      "type": "Object",
      "default": {}
    },
    {
      "name": "proximity",
      "type": "Array",
      "default": []
    },
    {
      "name": "summary",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": true
    },
    {
      "name": "closeOnSelect",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "anchor",
      "type": "String | Element",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "color",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "brand",
      "values": [
        "brand",
        "accent",
        "neutral",
        "success",
        "warning",
        "danger",
        "info"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "variant",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "outline",
      "values": [
        "outline",
        "soft"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "size",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "md",
      "values": [
        "xs",
        "sm",
        "md",
        "lg",
        "xl"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "density",
      "type": "String",
      "default": "default",
      "values": [
        "default",
        "comfortable",
        "compact"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "rounded",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null,
      "values": [
        "none",
        "xs",
        "sm",
        "md",
        "lg",
        "xl",
        "pill"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "block",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "disabled",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "readonly",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "label",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "hint",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "error",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "placeholder",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "required",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "name",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "id",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "split",
      "type": "Boolean",
      "default": false
    },
    {
      "name": "labelStart",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "labelEnd",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "placeholderStart",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    },
    {
      "name": "placeholderEnd",
      "type": "String",
      "default": null
    }
  ],
  "events": [
    {
      "name": "update:modelValue",
      "payload": "ISO | { start, end } | null",
      "trigger": "El valor completo cambia: elegir en single, completar un rango, ampliar con proximidad, limpiar (null). Un inicio pendiente NO lo emite"
    },
    {
      "name": "change",
      "payload": "igual",
      "trigger": "Igual que update:modelValue"
    },
    {
      "name": "start",
      "payload": "{ date }",
      "trigger": "Solo range: se elige el inicio (pendiente)"
    },
    {
      "name": "navigate",
      "payload": "{ month }",
      "trigger": "Cambia el mes visible (botones, teclado, deslizamiento)"
    },
    {
      "name": "update:open",
      "payload": "Boolean",
      "trigger": "El popover se abre o se cierra"
    },
    {
      "name": "open",
      "payload": "",
      "trigger": "El popover se abre"
    },
    {
      "name": "close",
      "payload": "",
      "trigger": "El popover se cierra, por el motivo que sea"
    }
  ],
  "slots": [
    {
      "name": "label",
      "purpose": "Etiqueta con contenido rico (sustituye a label)"
    },
    {
      "name": "hint",
      "purpose": "Ayuda con contenido rico"
    },
    {
      "name": "error",
      "purpose": "Mensaje de error con contenido rico; solo con error"
    },
    {
      "name": "trigger",
      "purpose": "Sustituye al campo por el botón de la aplicación. Alcance: { id, expanded, controls, toggle, open, close, value, text }. La aplicación pone aria-haspopup, aria-expanded, aria-controls y llama a toggle"
    },
    {
      "name": "summary",
      "purpose": "Sustituye al resumen. Alcance: { start, end, pending, days }"
    },
    {
      "name": "day",
      "purpose": "Contenido tras el número del día. Alcance: { date, day, selected, inRange, disabled, outside }. No cambia el nombre accesible ni el tamaño"
    },
    {
      "name": "icon",
      "purpose": "Icono del campo (sustituye al calendario dibujado); decorativo"
    }
  ],
  "tokens": [
    "--g-color-{color}",
    "--g-color-on-{color}",
    "--g-color-{color}-soft",
    "--g-color-on-{color}-soft",
    "--g-color-text",
    "--g-color-text-muted",
    "--g-color-text-subtle",
    "--g-color-surface",
    "--g-color-surface-sunken",
    "--g-color-border",
    "--g-color-border-control",
    "--g-color-border-strong",
    "--g-color-focus",
    "--g-color-danger-text",
    "--g-surface-inset",
    "--g-surface-gap",
    "--g-surface-radius",
    "--g-surface-radius-inset",
    "--g-surface-backdrop",
    "--g-shadow-2",
    "--g-shadow-3",
    "--g-radius-*",
    "--g-space-1..6",
    "--g-font-ui",
    "--g-text-{caption|body-sm|body}-{size|line}",
    "--g-text-title-sm-weight",
    "--g-text-body-weight",
    "--g-text-action-weight",
    "--g-border-width",
    "--g-focus-width",
    "--g-focus-offset",
    "--g-duration-fast",
    "--g-duration-press",
    "--g-ease-standard",
    "--g-ease-out"
  ],
  "states": [
    "closed",
    "open",
    "hover",
    "focus-visible",
    "disabled",
    "readonly",
    "invalid",
    "day-default",
    "day-today",
    "day-selected",
    "day-in-range",
    "day-range-start",
    "day-range-end",
    "day-preview",
    "day-inactive",
    "day-disabled",
    "day-outside",
    "one-month",
    "two-months",
    "sheet",
    "split",
    "inline",
    "with-proximity",
    "trigger-slot"
  ],
  "pending": [
    "Lector de pantalla real (cuadrícula, rango, título vivo, hoja móvil)",
    "RTL completo, Firefox y Safari (popover, ::backdrop, Intl.Locale.getWeekInfo, scale/rotate individuales)",
    "Hoja móvil con teclado virtual y deslizamiento en táctil real",
    "Franja del rango tenue (1.14:1 con el tema por defecto, 1.22:1 con el de prueba): decisión pendiente (ver auditoria.md)",
    "Escribir la fecha a mano (fuera de v0.1)"
  ]
}